ap per  person you know for each stock here we  have a three to four sauces but the  tradition way is only like icing that's  it  we're about using sesame peanut sauce we  couldn't have a cranberry I would like  them to try different favor so they  don't feel bored you know just a  different kind of taste in each wrap  twenty thirty years ago  people know more about American Chinese  food we'll just take our restaurant the  really traditional Chinese food which is  what we ate at home is not going by from  the takeout restaurant if all these  Chinese people eating at home  there's no Chinese food why they don't  serve in the restaurant so that's why we  try to create the menu for the new  version of Chinese food  [Music]

